<title>USA: Bankers Trust names Argentine director.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust names Argentine director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust New York Corp said on Wednesday that Salvatore Giannetti III has joined the firm as managing director of corporate finance for Argentina.</p>
<p>Giannetti, who was previously with Chase Manhattan Corp, will be responsible for developing further Bankers Trust's international corporate finance services for clients in Argentina, the company said.</p>
<p>Giannetti will report to Peter Getsinger, managing director and head of Emerging Markets Corporate Finance at Bankers Trust, the company said.</p>
</text>
